        "Content": "•\tAn Oasis of Tranquillity: An exceptionally peaceful, secluded, and gated rural-feeling setting tucked away off Station Road.\r\n\r\n•\tGenerous Site: Situated on surprisingly large, private grounds of approximately 0.3 acres with circa 154 sq.m. of comfortable living space.\r\n\r\n•\tUnique Aspect: Unrivalled views looking out toward Cush Point and directly overlooking the 5th green of Sutton Golf Club.\r\n\r\n•\tPrime Location & Convenience: Incredibly convenient to Sutton Cross, beaches, sports clubs, and just a short walk to the DART and bus links."
